urant. I was hungry later so I ate it. 
Oh My God.....I couldn't keep it down. I got such a stomach ache from that food. Petrini's , you are a local restaurant and I really try to support local businesses, but you are bad for my health."},{"review_date":"2016-07-11 15:51:04","review_stars":4.0,"review_text":"I have not been in here for many years, but we stopped in the other night and it was tasty traditional american italian food for a great price. The meat raviolis were very tender and delicious and the sauce was spot on. The spaghetti and meatballs (the yard stick for any italian review) were also very good. I also really enjoyed my cup of minestrone soup, really hit the spot. The waiters were very attentive and the place had a very welcoming and tidy atmosphere. 

The only downside, the water tasted horrible, I think they need to replace their filter or something."}],"state":"CA"}

